  m_Name: Bedtime Rule
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ruleDescription:
  - 'After some time, you might notice some changes to the portraits on the wall. '
  - 'You will want to soothe them with a nice story to put them at ease. '
  - 'Check out the bookshelves around the house, some of them have their favourite
    books. '
  - 'It will be up to you to figure out what they like. '
  - Don't make mistakes, they won't give you a second chance.
  ruleType: 1
